  "changes": [
    "kqs_collection.krx: operational stdlib port of the archived KRX Open API collector (same endpoints, normalization, schema, D-31 key handling); reviewed calendar sessions only, zero-row sessions fail, key excluded from repr/errors",
    "kqs_collection.coverage: coverage manifest from collection_log counts with a 1%/min-5 band against the previous session",
    "kqs_collection.quality: halted/no-trade KRX bars (open/high/low 0, zero volume/value, positive close/cap) are valid; inconsistent OHLC and priced zero-volume rows are rejected",
    "kqs_runtime.pipeline (kqs-daily-pipeline): collect -> coverage -> recorded quality run -> single-writer publish, immutable run log and status file",
    "kqs_ops: immutable pipeline run log, SQLite online backup with restore check/retention (kqs-backup), health check (kqs-pipeline-status)",
    "infra: engine worker image, engine-only compose profile, systemd timers and alert/upload hooks (not installed or deployed)"
  ],
